# stark_diag options, shown in the single STARK menu: main/Kconfig.projbuild
# sources this file (ARCHITECTURE.md §9).

config STARK_DIAG_LOG_PERIOD_S
    int "Diagnostics log period (s)"
    range 0 3600
    default 10
    help
        How often the `diag: heap=… fps=… drops=… overruns=…` line is
        logged: at the first sample and then every this many seconds;
        0 disables it. The sampler itself always runs once a second.
